  <definition>
    <key>plugnpay_ss2_note</key>
    <value><![CDATA[Hosted authorization-only checkout via PlugnPay Smart Screens v2 (https://pay1.plugnpay.com/pay/). Card data is collected on PlugnPay (lower PCI scope). Orders are left Pending until settled in PlugnPay Merchant Admin. No Remote Client Password is required.]]></value>
